  "details": "I have encountered an avatar that crash every Android player when a friend wearing that. As soon the friend switch to the avatar, android users start to leave the instance over and over. So I decided to gather the output log to investigate. I went Quest standalone, and asked the friend to change into the avatar. Soon after the download completed, VRChat crashed and I was sent to Quest home.\n\nThe friend says that she used [VRC Quest Tools](https://github.com/kurotu/VRCQuestTools) to covert avatar to Android compatible one. It sounds she had accdentally made the avatar to crash Android.\n\nThe output log is below:\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/camegone/e7b23e98f463a9639a25dcfba2624d1d",
